/ Our team</div><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg> Our team</span><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,54px);margin-top:14px\">People who know <span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">the last mile</span></h1><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">A founder-led team combining grassroots insight, technology and operations — guided by sector mentors and powered by 2000+ Saathis in the field.</p></div><div class=\"card reveal\"><h3 style=\"margin-bottom:6px\">Our team at a glance</h3><p style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">Core team of 13, plus a field network of 2000+ Saathis.</p>\n    <div class=\"prog\">\n      <div class=\"pr\"><span>Leadership <em>4</em></span><div class=\"track\"><div class=\"fill s-blue\" style=\"--w:30.8%\"></div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"pr\"><span>Support associates <em>5</em></span><div class=\"track\"><div class=\"fill s-green\" style=\"--w:38.5%\"></div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"pr\"><span>Partner relationship associates <em>2</em></span><div class=\"track\"><div class=\"fill s-red\" style=\"--w:15.4%\"></div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"pr\"><span>Account associates <em>2</em></span><div class=\"track\"><div class=\"fill s-navy\" style=\"--w:15.4%\"></div></div></div>\n    </div></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"chapter\" id=\"directors\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"cnum\">01</span><div><b>Directors</b><small>Our board of directors</small></div></div></div>\n<section><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:36px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M11.562 3.266a.5.5 0 0 1 .876 0L15.39 8.87a1 1 0 0 0 1.516.294L21.183 5.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .798.519l-2.834 10.246a1 1 0 0 1-.956.734H5.81a1 1 0 0 1-.957-.734L2.02 6.02a.5.5 0 0 1 .798-.519l4.276 3.664a1 1 0 0 0 1.516-.294z\"></path><path d=\"M5 21h14\"></path></svg> Board of directors</span><h2>Directors</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"grid g2\">\n    <div class=\"card reveal person2\"><div class=\"ph s-blue\">NS</div><div><h3>Naresh Sijapati</h3><b style=\"color:var(--blue);font-size:14px\">Founder, CEO & Director</b><p>Leads strategy, last-mile field operations and community entrepreneurship. A former child labourer who continued his education and worked with Teach for India, Naresh founded the first digital mobile office for migrants in 2015, led COVID-19 relief for 12,500+ families, the 5,100 km #WalkForMigrant and the 11,111 km Walk for Dignity.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"card reveal person2\"><div class=\"ph s-green\">BB</div><div><h3>Bhavika Bhogekar</h3><b style=\"color:var(--green);font-size:14px\">Co-founder, COO & Director</b><p>Leads finance, HR and company operations — keeping Online Saathi compliant, efficient and ready to grow.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n<div class=\"chapter\" id=\"advisors\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"cnum\">02</span><div><b>Mentors & advisors</b><small>Guided by sector leaders</small></div></div></div>\n<section class=\"sec-alt\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:70px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"background:var(--gtint);color:var(--green)\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg> Mentors & advisors</span><h2>Mentors & advisors</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"leader\">\n    <div class=\"lcard reveal\"><div class=\"top\" style=\"background:var(--tint)\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"color:var(--blue)\">VM</div></div><div class=\"bd\"><h3>Vivek Mathur</h3><small>Elevation Capital</small><p>Venture capital and scaling guidance.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"lcard reveal\"><div class=\"top\" style=\"background:var(--gtint)\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">UT</div></div><div class=\"bd\"><h3>Ujwal Thakar</h3><small>former Give / PwC India</small><p>Philanthropy, governance and partnerships.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"lcard reveal\"><div class=\"top\" style=\"background:var(--rtint)\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"color:var(--red)\">NJ</div></div><div class=\"bd\"><h3>Nikunj Jhaveri</h3><small>System Plus</small><p>Technology and product engineering.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"lcard reveal\"><div class=\"top\" style=\"background:#FFF4DC\"><div class=\"ph\" style=\"color:#B57800\">DT</div></div><div class=\"bd\"><h3>Dinesh Tyagi, IAS (retd.)</h3><small>former CEO, CSC e-Gov India</small><p>Public digital service delivery at national scale.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n<div class=\"chapter\" id=\"our-team\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"cnum\">03</span><div><b>Our team</b><small>Every department and every member</small></div></div></div>\n<section><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"dept\">\n    <div class=\"card reveal\"><h3><span class=\"chip c-blue\" style=\"margin:0;width:40px;height:40px\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.